    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit is a Multiplayer Platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle against other Players and/or AI controlled Bots across a variety of different planets. Gain the advantage by earning XP and looting each Planet before your opponents do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Gravity Mechanic</strong> - Players can travel around all 4 sides of a Planet, adding new ways to explore the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Full Multiplayer/Online Support</strong> - Players can easily host and join other games at the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Random Procedural Generation</strong> - Planets are randomly generated meaning levels/maps are different each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Customisation</strong> - Characters can be customised with a variety of different Armours and Colours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>XP/Leveling System</strong> - Earn XP by looting and fighting. This can then be used to gain new abilities and upgrade stats of your choice, depending on your own playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Weapons</strong> - From a &quot;Giant Battery&quot; to a &quot;Snake-Whip&quot;, there's many weapons to find to defeat your enemies with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Abilities/Finishers</strong> - Each weapon has a &quot;Special&quot; attack linked with it. Save these attacks for just the right time to surprise opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Retro-Like Aesthetic </strong> - The game is heavily inspired from 16-bit games and follows a similar art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord!: </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit is a Multiplayer Platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle against other Players and/or AI controlled Bots across a variety of different planets. Gain the advantage by earning XP and looting each Planet before your opponents do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Gravity Mechanic</strong> - Players can travel around all 4 sides of a Planet, adding new ways to explore the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Full Multiplayer/Online Support</strong> - Players can easily host and join other games at the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Random Procedural Generation</strong> - Planets are randomly generated meaning levels/maps are different each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Customisation</strong> - Characters can be customised with a variety of different Armours and Colours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>XP/Leveling System</strong> - Earn XP by looting and fighting. This can then be used to gain new abilities and upgrade stats of your choice, depending on your own playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Weapons</strong> - From a &quot;Giant Battery&quot; to a &quot;Snake-Whip&quot;, there's many weapons to find to defeat your enemies with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Abilities/Finishers</strong> - Each weapon has a &quot;Special&quot; attack linked with it. Save these attacks for just the right time to surprise opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Retro-Like Aesthetic </strong> - The game is heavily inspired from 16-bit games and follows a similar art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord!: </p>",
